// ShatteredGlass (shatteredglass_ps20b / shatteredglass_vs20): base times
// detail (uv2 through the detail scale) lit partly by the lightmap
// ($unlitfactor), with vertex color, and the Fresnel-weighted cube map
// reflection masked by the envmap mask and the base alpha; CUBEMAP normalizes
// through the material system's signed normalization cube map
// ("normalizesigned", s6). Cube maps are point-sampled (Vulkan filters cube
// maps seamlessly across faces, D3D9 within a face).
